{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510179","name":"嘉明【彩蛋】","desc":"嘉明彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/21/50494840/39a1c8f794dc0a04c74335faaaf59a82_2757070651861476743.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e剑匣镖局的镖师，威水舞兽队的话事人。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/03/50494840/2b04443b4a98a07ab7e933399fbd2e6e_8164950576941919054.png\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"角色名\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e嘉明\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"生日\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e12月22日\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"所属\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e剑匣镖局\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/03/50494840/6c46f901734c54ad6d309c134a0383dc_3838734272600268851.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"child_ids\":{\"bm080wzte8oT1772505578662\":[]},\"contents\":{\"841c79qr4teT1772506259792\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：要等多久会熟？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嘉明：跟你聊完这些之后，不迟不早，时间刚刚好，不要眨眼啊——\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：「淬金冷玉」出锅，嗱，像这样表面发出琉璃那样的光泽，说明火候刚刚好，又好看又好吃。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：你尝一下？看合不合你口味？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：喜欢的话，下次继续做给你吃咯。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：放心，自己吃的随便一点没所谓，招呼朋友我一定跟足烹饪步骤来炮制。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"b9rdvifz2jeT1772506182337\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：好复杂…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嘉明：但是这次不一样！不能浪费这么靓的禽肉啊！等一下你就知道了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：反正现在已经到了最后也是最关键的一步：将火力控制到最小，让禽肉在锅里慢慢浸熟，给点耐心…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"bm080wzte8oT1772505578662\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"dp4p1tvs2wjT1772505960438\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：居然是…淬、淬金冷玉？！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嘉明：难道你也吃过这味菜吗？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"drcj680h4rvT1772505727967\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嘉明：咦？是旅行者啊！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：哈哈，真是白天不要讲人夜晚不要讲鬼，刚才还在想，要是你来了就有人陪我吃了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：多谢你关心先，我怎么会被劫镖咧？明明刚刚才安全送完一镖，我们认识这么久，你没理由信不过我的身手的。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"gn8zd6yupf9T1772505617384\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：嘉明？怎么一个人在这荒郊僻野？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"huap22lmxcT1772506075762\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：哈哈，没有。只是觉得名字很厉害！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嘉明：哈哈，何止名字厉害啊，味道也不得了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：其实这道菜是家里的帮工小梁教我的，他跟我老妈是老乡，说老妈旧时最喜欢吃这道菜喔。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：不过我也没有全部照搬，按自己喜欢的口味改良了下。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：把水煲滚，加点盐，新鲜的禽肉放下去泡一泡，但一定要记得不能泡久了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：基本在心里默念完「烧卖虾饺叉烧包，白灼生菜萝卜糕」就要马上捞出来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：重复三次这样的步骤后，把禽肉放进泡着冰雾花的山泉水里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：一热一冷，是不是很像打铁的师傅淬火那样？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"j1bbq9flk4mT1772505802505\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：那你这是在…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嘉明：放松点，闻一闻？闻到香味了吗？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"w76k90399oT1772505618068\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：不会被劫镖了吧？！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"wkytsov06tT1772505837413\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：哇好香！在做什么好吃的吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嘉明：嘿嘿，识货。呐，你有口福了，准备有得吃了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：刚刚那趟镖的老板在山里面开了家农庄，好巧不巧，今天计错数，多准备了一些食材，就让我带回去。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：那个禽肉真的很靓，哦，我的意思是很新鲜，肉质很好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：加上回去的路上还有山泉水，天时地利都出现了…看来也是时候做点事情来凑齐「人和」了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘉明：所以我决定亲手做一道的记忆中——「淬金冷玉」！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"bm080wzte8oT1772505578662\"}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"r2qz6zt2orT1772505578705\",\"child_ids\":{\"r2qz6zt2orT1772505578705\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"76tk34f8h5cT1772505578726\",\"child_ids\":{\"76tk34f8h5cT1772505578726\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"8jlksxxi8n5T1772505578731\",\"child_ids\":{\"8jlksxxi8n5T1772505578731\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"够钟！起身！——2025-12-22\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e喂老友！醒了没？起身起身，够钟起身！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e天都没亮，文仔就把纸笔放在我脸上来，催我给你写信了。照他老人家的意思，说很想你过来玩喔。嗱，他看我写得慢急得在桌上转来转去，一分钟之前把茶打翻了，根据经验，再过两分钟老爸就会来拍门问我们是不是在房间里打仗…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e文仔不识字，被他知道我在信里写他这些糗事，那就真的要「打仗」了哈哈，帮我保守秘密噢！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e说是说请你过来饮饮食食，但其实最紧要的是想见见老友。听闻你在处理一个大难题，还是想亲眼确认你平安才能放心。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e煽情的话不多讲了，心照了。等你来噢！我去应付老爸先…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"831\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/26f915d93ca74fc9a520f3a1bdc5427f_3255367856372646779.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「繁荣」的指引\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/831/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/831/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「繁荣」的指引\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500689\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/31/75610764/aa27f107f734ea251fb36e890a49d889_1009431831064920148.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"蜜汁叉烧\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500689/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500689/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u00